        "content": "## Get a social media post by ID\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Fetches a single post by its ID.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] Provide the ID of the post you want to act on.\n\n### Customization\n\nMap the post ID from an upstream workflow to operate on the right post. Run it any time to post, or connect a Schedule Trigger to automate it. Everything runs inside your own n8n workspace, so you can change any step after import. Run it once with a test post to confirm every node behaves as expected before you rely on it.",
